# Stamford Marketing Website

This is a marketing website. Keep UI polished, content-focused, and on-brand.

## Styling

- Use **Tailwind CSS utility classes only** for styling in components.
- **Never use hex colors (`#...`) in `.jsx` or `.tsx` files.** Use theme classes instead:
  - `text-primary` / `bg-primary` — primary green
  - `text-secondary` / `bg-secondary` — secondary blue
  - `text-black` / `bg-black` / `text-white` / `bg-white`
  - `text-foreground` / `bg-background`
- Hex values live in `src/app/globals.css` only.

## Typography

- **Headings:** `font-heading` (Playfair Display)
- **Body / descriptions:** `font-body` or default (Arial)

## Icons

- Use **Lucide React** (`lucide-react`) for all icons globally.
- Import icons directly: `import { Phone, ChevronDown } from "lucide-react"`
- Do not use inline SVGs or other icon libraries.
- Size with Tailwind classes: `className="h-4 w-4"`

## Examples

```tsx
// BAD — hex in component
<h1 className="text-[#63AC48]">Title</h1>

// GOOD — theme classes
<h1 className="font-heading text-primary text-4xl">Title</h1>
<p className="font-body text-foreground">Description text</p>
<button className="bg-secondary text-white">CTA</button>
```
